{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/retry(_:on:)-4vycy"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Retries the upstream "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" up to a specified number of times only when a specific error type is encountered."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"retry"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"retries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su","text":"UInt"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOnCast","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO11RetryOnCastC","text":"RetryOnCast"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC","text":"RetryByCountStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":